# PokeAPI CSV dumps, fetched on demand by scripts/i18n/pokeapi.ts.
# Deliberately not committed: nothing in `npm run build` or CI reads them, and
# the *outputs* generated from them are committed — so upstream drift shows up
# as a diff in src/i18n/names/ rather than being hidden by a stale cache. They
# are ~730 kB and 21k lines of pure noise in a review.
docs/i18n/pokeapi/

